        "original_id": "fb5a37bc-51a5-51b2-863c-faca6120b22a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rick Seibold, Lee DeWyze, David Archuleta, Katelyn Tarver, Kat DeLuna, Alex Lambert, Drew Pearson, Julian Emery, Justin Irvin, Shelly Fairchild, Matthew Wilder, Toby Gad\n- Albums: Frames\n- TV Series: Big Time Rush, No Ordinary Family, The Secret Life of the American Teenager\n- Organizations: Nickelodeon, ABC, ABC Family\n\nFacts:\n- Rick Seibold has worked with Lee DeWyze, David Archuleta, Katelyn Tarver, Kat DeLuna, and Alex Lambert.\n- Katelyn Tarver is known for recurring roles as Jo Taylor on Nickelodeon's Big Time Rush, Natalie on ABC's No Ordinary Family, and Mercedes on ABC Family's The Secret Life of the American Teenager.\n- On the album Frames, Lee DeWyze has six solo writing credits.\n- On the album Frames, Lee DeWyze was also a co-writer on all of the other songs with Drew Pearson, Julian Emery, Justin Irvin, Shelly Fairchild, Rick Seibold, Matthew Wilder, and Toby Gad.",
